Reminder V1.0

This is an Excelsior! Only door, will not work with other systems.
You may distribute this software freely.

Reminder is an utility that asks the user at logoff if he wants to leave
a message to the next users. If yes, a text file is saved containing
the 80 chars string that he wrote. This string is then shown to every
user at logon until modified.

Instalation:

Reminder is a two program pack.

"Askuser" will ask the user for a string.
"ShowUser" will show the string to a user.

Modify you /LANGUAGES/ENGLISH (or any other) file in lines:

105-
\#2BBS:C/ShowUser\n1\q1\Login complete\n1

941-
\#2BBS:C/AskUser\n1Would you like to leave feedback <y/N>? \?0

This should work with versions up to 0.979. 
If you want a special version for your own language, translate the text and
contact me and I will compile the programs for you.

Written in SAS_C 6.1 by Celso Martinho
